· 毛亨、鄭氏、孔穎達","era":"漢唐","publicationYear":653,"carrier":"TXT"},"annotation":{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"瑳兮瑳兮其之展也蒙彼縐絺是紲袢也子之清揚揚且之顏也展如之人兮邦之媛也","targetNotes":"卒章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《毛詩正義/卷三》君子偕老卒章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":null,"text":"瑳，鮮白。展，誠也。之子之服飾，誠美盛矣。蒙，覆也。縐絺，絺之蹙蹙者。是當暑袢延之服也。子之，清揚。揚，眉上廣。展，誠也。美女為媛。箋云：展如，當如禮也。邦人所依倚以為媛助者。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"篇序","title":"君子偕老刺衛夫人也夫人淫亂失事君子之道故陳人君之德服…","href":"/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0001-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0002","order":2,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"君子偕老副笄六珈委委佗佗如山如河象服是宜子之不淑雲如…","href":"/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0002-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0003","order":3,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"玼兮玼兮其之翟也鬒髮如雲不屑髢也玉之瑱也象之揥也揚且…","href":"/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0003-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0004","order":4,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"瑳兮瑳兮其之展也蒙彼縐絺是紲袢也子之清揚揚且之顏也展…","href":"/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0004-1","isCurrent":true}],"previous":{"title":"玼兮玼兮其之翟也鬒髮如雲不屑髢也玉之瑱也象之揥也揚且…","href":"/shijing/gloss/047-jun-zi-xie-lao/maoheng-zhushu-kr1c0004/0003-1"},"next":null,"gloss":{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"毛传","sectionLabel":null,"text":"瑳，鮮白。展，誠也。之子之服飾，誠美盛矣。蒙，覆也。縐絺，絺之蹙蹙者。是當暑袢延之服也。子之，清揚。揚，眉上廣。展，誠也。美女為媛。箋云：展如，當如禮也。邦人所依倚以為媛助者。","notes":null,"id":"0004-1","order":1,"total":1,"annotationId":"0004","parts":[{"id":"part-1","order":1,"excerpt":"瑳，鮮白。展，誠也。之子之服飾，誠美盛矣。","anchors":[{"key":"1-1","segmentId":"seg-017","surfaceText":"瑳","charStart":1,"charEnd":1},{"key":"1-2","segmentId":"seg-018","surfaceText":"展","charStart":3,"charEnd":3}]},{"id":"part-2","order":2,"excerpt":"蒙，覆也。縐絺，絺之蹙蹙者。是當暑袢延之服也。","anchors":[{"key":"2-1","segmentId":"seg-019","surfaceText":"蒙","charStart":1,"charEnd":1},{"key":"2-2","segmentId":"seg-019","surfaceText":"縐絺","charStart":3,"charEnd":4},{"key":"2-3","segmentId":"seg-020","surfaceText":"袢","charStart":3,"charEnd":3}]},{"id":"part-3","order":3,"excerpt":"子之，清揚。揚，眉上廣。","anchors":[{"key":"3-1","segmentId":"seg-021","surfaceText":"清揚","charStart":3,"charEnd":4},{"key":"3-2","segmentId":"seg-022","surfaceText":"揚","charStart":1,"charEnd":1}]},{"id":"part-4","order":4,"excerpt":"展，誠也。美女為媛。箋云：展如，當如禮也。邦人所依倚以為媛助者。","anchors":[{"key":"4-1","segmentId":"seg-023","surfaceText":"展如","charStart":1,"charEnd":2},{"key":"4-2","segmentId":"seg-024","surfaceText":"媛","charStart":3,"charEnd":3}]}]}}}}
